  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the fenugreek leaves and pat them dry with a paper towel.",
    "In a bowl, mix together the shredded kunefe cheese, water, lemon juice, olive oil, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the fenugreek leaves to the bowl and mix until they are well coated with the cheese mixture.",
    "Using your hands, shape the mixture into small nigiri shapes.",
    "Place the shaped kunefe in a lacquerware bowl.",
    "Serve the Yellowed Turkish Fenugreek Kunefe immediately.",
    "Garnish with additional fenugreek leaves if desired."
